    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840960/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748223173\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Savoring Sword has been gifted to you by a mysterious woman! It feasts on the energy of everything it dominates! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore procedurally generated dungeons, fight monster girls, interact with your surroundings, collect items, and gain weight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840960/extras/a1215222476eaac02d68ad8f9844334b.webp?t=1748223173\" width=240 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three girls who gain weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 monster girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of traps and interactables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 Outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifiers, enhancements, achievements, and more!  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETTER PERFORMANCE FILES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are running the game with less than 16GB RAM, switching to the Better Performance versions will reduced the image quality by half so the game can run more smoothly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do this, simply go to Savoring Sword in your Library, then click Settings &gt; Properties &gt; Betas and select 'betterperformance' from the Beta Participation tab.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840960/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748223173\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Savoring Sword has been gifted to you by a mysterious woman! It feasts on the energy of everything it dominates! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore procedurally generated dungeons, fight monster girls, interact with your surroundings, collect items, and gain weight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840960/extras/a1215222476eaac02d68ad8f9844334b.webp?t=1748223173\" width=240 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three girls who gain weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 monster girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of traps and interactables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 Outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modifiers, enhancements, achievements, and more!  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETTER PERFORMANCE FILES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are running the game with less than 16GB RAM, switching to the Better Performance versions will reduced the image quality by half so the game can run more smoothly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do this, simply go to Savoring Sword in your Library, then click Settings &gt; Properties &gt; Betas and select 'betterperformance' from the Beta Participation tab.</p>",
